From: Radeon24 <Radeon24@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: add the fortinet directory

Build the device trees of arch/arm/boot/dts/fortinet (FortiGate 60C,
60D, 60E).
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Radeon24 <Radeon24@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/Makefile
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@ subdir-y += broadcom
 subdir-y += calxeda
 subdir-y += cirrus
 subdir-y += cnxt
+subdir-y += fortinet
 subdir-y += gemini
 subdir-y += hisilicon
 subdir-y += hpe
